Verse 1:
[Ab]‘Tis love that makes us happy,
[Cm]‘Tis love [Db]that smooths [Fm]the way;
[Ab]It helps us mind, it makes [Db]us kind
[Bbm]To others [Eb7]every [Ab]day.

Refrain:
[Ab]God is love; we're his little children.
[Ab]God is [Db]love; we would be like [Ab]Him.
[Ab]'Tis love that makes us happy,
[Ab]'Tis love [Bbm]that smooths the way;
[Ab]It helps us "mind," it makes us kind
[Cm]To others [Db]every [Fm]day.

Verse 2:
[Ab]This world is full of sorrow,
[Cm]Of sickness, [Db]death, [Fm]and sin;
[Ab]With loving heart we'll do [Db]our part,
[Bbm]And try [Eb7]some soul [Ab]to win.

Verse 3:
[Ab]And when this life is over,
[Cm]And we [Db]are called [Fm]above
[Ab]Our song shall be, eternally,
[Bbm]Of Jesus [Eb7]and [Ab]His love.
